Go Hive
=======

Go Hive (go_hive/go-hive) is a pure-Go rewrite of OpenHive.

Upstream project : OpenHive (aden-hive/hive)
Upstream source  : https://github.com/aden-hive/hive
Upstream license : Apache License, Version 2.0
Copyright        : Copyright 2024 Aden

This distribution contains a Go implementation that ports the behaviour of
the upstream Python runtime (reference: aden-hive / aden-tools 1.0.14,
commit c6c2cdcf). The Go sources are new or substantially rewritten rather
than a line-by-line copy, so this NOTICE records the derivation explicitly.

The upstream copyright notice above and the Apache License 2.0 terms in the
root LICENSE file are retained unchanged. Nothing in this NOTICE modifies,
supersedes or removes any upstream copyright notice or license term.

The root LICENSE file covers this repository. The Go module in
go_hive/go-hive carries the same Apache-2.0 license in its own LICENSE file
(an identical copy, verified by SHA-256).

Third-party components and the licenses they are distributed under are
listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md at the repository root. That file records
license names, roles and source links only; it does not reproduce third-party
license texts.
